# LF everywhere in the repo, whatever a member's core.autocrlf says: bash fails on CRLF scripts ("$'\r': command
# not found"), and CRLF in memory files makes every line of a diff change.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
